            "review_text": "Hong\nBristol, United Kingdom5 contributions\n0\nScammer\nJan 2026 • Family\nVery disappointed with this restaurant. There is a price list clearly displayed, but they charged us more than the listed price for several items. When my parents and I asked why the bill was higher, the owner (who was extremely rude and unprofessional) told us it was because of “New Year,” so they decided to charge more. \nAnd we are Vietnamese.\n\nIf prices are higher for holidays, they should update the menu or clearly inform customers before ordering. Charging more than the listed price without warning is unacceptable.\n\nOn top of that, the owner’s attitude was horrible — very disrespectful and dismissive when we simply asked for an explanation.\n\nI would not recommend this place. Please check your bill carefully if you decide to go.\nAnd the food is absolutely disgusting.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDon’t come there .\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 11, 2026",
