            "review_text": "Ray K\nSydney, Australia150 contributions\n1\nQuite delicious for a quick snack.\nMar 2018 • Couples\nIf you want a traditional Vietnamese sticky rice snack (as if you could actually be hungry in Vietnam!) Then give this little eatery a go. Simple sticky rice with either pork or chicken (I preferred the pork, my wife preferred the chicken) Ice cold tea and then you are on your way. There are two similar restaurants almost side by side, but the purported tensions between them seem non existent. We ate in both and effectively got the same meals in both. The food was not spicy.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 17, 2018",
